  "description": "As far as Myojin is concerned, his relationship with Yijo is destiny. But if you asked Yijo, he’d tell you they were just hooking up. He might even tell you it’s out of spite. To Yijo, Myojin is just his ex’s latest lover and an easy route to take revenge. Because Yijo won’t fall in love again, and he doesn’t get happy endings—no matter how handsome, sweet, and adoring Myojin is. This time, Yijo will be the one breaking hearts. \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes nine extra chapters.*",
